1
00:00:00,530 --> 00:00:02,030
I love you, Penny!

2
00:00:05,635 --> 00:00:08,375
(Sheldon:)How is it I can conceptualize
a methodology

3
00:00:08,538 --> 00:00:10,538
(Sheldon:)of examining dark matter
in the universe

4
00:00:10,707 --> 00:00:13,817
(Sheldon:)but can't figure out how
to fix a novelty squirt flower?

5
00:00:15,011 --> 00:00:16,511
(Amy:)I think the real question is,

6
00:00:16,680 --> 00:00:19,660
(Amy:)why do you waste your time
with cheap, childish pranks?

7
00:00:20,383 --> 00:00:22,123
(Sheldon:)There's probably a deep reason,

8
00:00:22,285 --> 00:00:24,325
(Sheldon:)which I'd be happy
to discuss with you

9
00:00:24,487 --> 00:00:26,797
(Sheldon:)over some peanut brittle in a can.

10
00:00:28,124 --> 00:00:30,294
Okay, Sheldon, I am out of options!

11
00:00:30,460 --> 00:00:33,460
(Leonard:)Video store owner, Nursis Manookian,

12
00:00:33,630 --> 00:00:34,870
has no next of kin!

13
00:00:35,465 --> 00:00:38,035
(Sheldon:)Well, you seem hot
under the collar...

14
00:00:38,201 --> 00:00:39,981
(Sheldon:)Or is that the sweater?

15
00:00:40,570 --> 00:00:43,380
(Leonard:)Oh, oh, no, no.
It's because I spent all afternoon

16
00:00:43,540 --> 00:00:45,850
(Leonard:)at the Armenian church
where his funeral mass was held.

17
00:00:46,009 --> 00:00:47,819
(Leonard:)According to Father Solakian,

18
00:00:47,978 --> 00:00:49,428
(Leonard:)no one attended.

19
00:00:49,579 --> 00:00:51,319
(Leonard:)Luckily, my trip
wasn't a complete waste.

20
00:00:51,481 --> 00:00:52,721
(Leonard:)I lit a candle
and prayed for your death.

21
00:00:52,883 --> 00:00:55,333
(Leonard:)But I'm not Armenian,
so it probably won't work!

22
00:00:57,754 --> 00:00:59,254
(Leonard:)This is over, right?

23
00:00:59,422 --> 00:01:02,022
(Sheldon:)Oh, not necessarily.

